cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the paper below."
title: "NCWP: Neighbor-Contrastive Whitening Projection"
abstract: >-
  Label-free post-hoc alignment of frozen decoder-only LLM hidden states for
  symmetric sentence-similarity retrieval. NCWP combines ZCA-shrink whitening
  with augmentation-free neighbor-contrastive projection learning, requiring
  only a single linear projection at inference.
authors:
